text Pokedude_Text_SpeedierBattlerGoesFirst {
    "Poké Dude: The speedier of the\n"
    "battlers gets to attack first.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_MyRattataFasterThanPidgey {
    "It looks like my Rattata was\n"
    "faster than the Pidgey.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_BattlersTakeTurnsAttacking {
    "The battlers take turns attacking\n"
    "and reducing each other's HP.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_MyRattataWonGetsEXP {
    "My Rattata reduced the foe's HP\n"
    "to zero, so it wins!\p"
    "The Pokémon that took part in the\n"
    "battle get EXP. Points.\p"
    "When a Pokémon collects enough\n"
    "EXP. Points, it levels up.\p"
    "Leveling up makes your Pokémon\n"
    "stronger than before.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_UhOhRattataPoisoned {
    "Poké Dude: Uh-oh…\n"
    "My Rattata has been poisoned…\p"
    "If a Pokémon is poisoned, it loses\n"
    "HP steadily.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_HealStatusRightAway {
    "If a Pokémon develops a status\n"
    "problem, heal it right away.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_UsingItemTakesTurn {
    "Using an item on a Pokémon uses\n"
    "up one turn, though.\p"
    "Now, it's the opponent's turn!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_YayWeManagedToWin {
    "Yay!\n"
    "We managed to win!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_WaterNotVeryEffectiveAgainstGrass {
    "Poké Dude: The move Bubble is\n"
    "a Water-type attack.\p"
    "The targeted Oddish is a\n"
    "Grass/Poison-type Pokémon.\p"
    "The Water-type attack is absorbed\n"
    "by the Grass-type Pokémon…\p"
    "As a result, the move becomes not\n"
    "very effective, and inflicts only\l"
    "half the usual damage.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_GrassEffectiveAgainstWater {
    "Uh-oh, this is not good!\p"
    "The Absorb attack you just saw\n"
    "is a Grass-type move.\p"
    "Poliwag is a Water-type Pokémon.\p"
    "So, Absorb becomes super\n"
    "effective, doubling the damage.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_LetsTryShiftingMons {
    "It's not going to be easy to win\n"
    "with this matchup…\p"
    "Let's try shifting Pokémon!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_ShiftingUsesTurn {
    "Shifting Pokémon in and out uses\n"
    "up one turn.\p"
    "Now, it's the opponent's turn.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_ButterfreeDoubleResistsGrass {
    "Butterfree is a Bug/Flying-type\n"
    "Pokémon.\p"
    "Against this Pokémon, a Grass-\n"
    "type attack…\p"
    "…inflicts only half the usual\n"
    "damage on a Bug-type Pokémon…\p"
    "…And, it also causes only half the\n"
    "damage on a Flying-type Pokémon.\p"
    "Therefore, Butterfree, being a\n"
    "Bug/Flying Pokémon, only takes\l"
    "one quarter of the usual damage.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_ButterfreeGoodAgainstOddish {
    "Oddish is a Grass/Poison-type\n"
    "Pokémon.\p"
    "A Flying- or Psychic-type attack\n"
    "is super effective against it.\p"
    "One of those types of attacks will\n"
    "inflict double the usual damage.\p"
    "Okay, here we go!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_YeahWeWon {
    "Yeah!\n"
    "We won!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_WeakenMonBeforeCatching {
    "Poké Dude: When you're trying to\n"
    "catch a Pokémon, don't throw any\l"
    "Poké Balls right away.\p"
    "First, you need to weaken it by\n"
    "reducing its HP.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_BestIfTargetStatused {
    "Okay, that should be good enough.\p"
    "But, if it's possible, it would be\n"
    "best if the target has a status\l"
    "problem.\p"
    "For instance, it would be easier\n"
    "to catch if it were asleep or\l"
    "paralyzed.$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_CantDoubleUpOnStatus {
    "This will make the Pokémon a lot\n"
    "easier to catch!\p"
    "Oh, yes. If you paralyze a\n"
    "Pokémon, you can't make it fall\l"
    "asleep on top of paralysis.\p"
    "In other words, you can't double\n"
    "up status problems, okay?$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_LetMeThrowBall {
    "Okay!\n"
    "Let me throw my Poké Ball!$"
}

text Pokedude_Text_PickBestKindOfBall {
    "Before you throw a Poké Ball,\n"
    "consider the condition and the\l"
    "type of Pokémon, and pick the kind\l"
    "of Ball that would work best.$"
}
